 am eager \\nto contribute to impactful software projects , combining my skills in frontend and backend \\ntechnologies.\\n \\nCORE SKILLS  \\nTechnical Skills:  \\n\\u2022 Programming: Python  for data analysis , JavaScript, Node.js, React.js, SQL  \\n\\u2022 Database Management: MySQL, MariaDB, PostgreSQL  \\n\\u2022 Cloud & DevOps: Microsoft Azure (VMs, Storage, Networking), Git  \\n\\u2022 Networking: Cisco CCNA (Introduction to Networks), Network Security  \\nSoft Skills:  \\n\\u2022 Problem -solving & Critical Thinking  \\n\\u2022 Collaboration & Teamwork  \\n\\u2022 Effective Communication  \\n\\u2022 Project Management  \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n WORK EXPERIENCE  \\nData Science Intern | Sankhyana Con sultancy services  \\nMarch 2024 \\u2013 Present  \\n\\u2022 Developed a GPT -powered web tool to evaluate CV and job description similarity using \\nNLP techniques.  \\n\\u2022 Designed a scheduling website that integrates Google Meet API to book interviews based \\non available time slots from both candidate and interviewer.  \\n \\nIT Attach\\u00e9 | Kenya National Commission on Human Rights (KNCHR)  \\nJanuary 2024 \\u2013 March 2024  \\n\\u2022 Assisted in network infrastructure management and ensured secure connectivity.  \\n\\u2022 Managed database systems, optimizing query performance and troubleshooting issues.  \\n\\u2022 Provided IT support, troubleshooting hardware/software issues for staff.  \\n\\u2022 Implemented data security best practices to safeguard sensitive information.  \\nVolunteer | Kenya Community Support Centre  \\nJanuary 2023 \\u2013 March 2023  \\n\\u2022 Designed and developed a community forum website to enhance user interaction.  \\n\\u2022 Analyzed meeting attendance data to improve engagement strategies.  \\n\\u2022 Assisted in organizing meetings between communities and government officials.  \\n \\n \\n \\nCERTIFICATIONS  \\nCredable Futures Hackathon for Software Engineering -May 2024  \\nDevelop an innovative invoice analysis tool